    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102782" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέθριππος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέτταρα, ἵππος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with four horses yoked abreast</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					1.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζεῦγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					346
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					1212
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἡλίου σέλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>El.</u>
					866
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἅμιλλαι</span> chariot-races,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				386
			</span></i>; of the charioteer, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ Λυδοὶ ἐπὶ Πέλοπος τέθριπποι . .
					ἦσαν [καὶ] ἤδη ἁρματῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					1.17
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ</span> secl. Schenkl).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέθριππον</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρμα</span>), τό,
				<i>four-horse chariot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				2.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.103
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				428
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ly.</u>
				205c
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἵππων</span>
			<i>a team of four abreast</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1407
			</span></i>: pl., of a single chariot, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				177
			</span></i>.</div>
